# vllm-moe ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** vLLM variant with CPU expert offload and GPU prefetch.

**LEONES status:** P2; experimental.

## Summary

vllm-moe explores an extension of vLLM in which expert weights remain primarily in CPU memory while active experts are prefetched to GPU.

## ODS fit

The architecture is attractive because it combines a mature serving engine with an MoE-specific memory strategy.

It should be evaluated against upstream vLLM developments and MoE-Infinity before becoming an ODS dependency.